      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Using MySQL Proxy for scale out, tracking queries, modifying and denying&#xA;SQL. All controlled by a LUA script, transparent to the application and&#xA;with as little latency as possible.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
